		//535 -----------------------------------
		,(code		:= 17431
		,message 	:= '17431.  ?Tolerance window for modulo-start? The value for the tolerance window for the modulo-axis-start is invalid. The value must be greater or equal than zero and smaller than the half encoder modulo-period (e. g. in the interval [0.0,180.0) ).')
