		,message 	:= '17436.  ?Encoder sign interpretation (UNSIGNED- / SIGNED- data type)? The value for the encoder sign interpretation (data type) for the encoder the actual increment calculation (0: Default/not defined, 1: UNSIGNED, 2:/ SIGNED) is invalid.')
