		,(code		:= 18000
		,message 	:= '18000.  Drive not ready for operation The drive is not ready for operation. The following are possible causes: - the drive is in failure state (hardware fault) - the drive is in the starting-up stage (e.g. following an axis reset preceded by a hardware fault) - the drive has not been enabled Remark: The time required for booting a drive after a hardware fault can amount to several seconds.')
